[01:21.72]countertrade [ˈkaʊntəˌtreɪd]n. 反向贸易；对销贸易 例 Countertrade can be used to stimulate home industries or where raw materials are in short supply. 反向贸易可以用来促进国内产业或 者原材料短缺的产业。
