[14:11.64]forefront [ˈfɔːfrʌnt]n. 最前线；最前部；最重要之处 例 We launched different actions to convince the consumers of the importance of this problem, especially at the forefront was the question linked with health and safety. 我们开 展了不同的活动以使消费者认识到这一问题的重 要性，尤其是涉及健康和安全的问题。 搭 at/in the forefront of 在…的最前部
[14:40.92]declassify [ˌdiːˈklæsɪfaɪ]vt. 撤销…的机密等级 例 Only recently has the Japanese government begun to acknowledge the case and to declassify historical records on it. 直到近期， 日本政府才开始承认该事件并解密其历史记录。
[15:00.24]let [let]v. 出租 例 He decided to let the larger room at a monthly rent of ￥1000. 他决定把较大的房间以 每月1000元的价格出租。
[15:10.44]sequence [ˈsiːkwəns]n. 顺序；连续；序列；程序；续发事 件 搭 a sequence of 一连串的
